@startuml
title Secuencia: crear pregunta
actor Autor
participant "banco-service\nQuestionController" as API
participant "BearerAuthFilter" as Auth
participant "QuestionService" as Service
participant "QuestionPipeline" as Pipeline
database "banco.db" as DB
participant "RabbitMQ\nsaberpro.events" as MQ
participant "auditoria-service" as Audit
Autor -> API : POST /preguntas + Bearer
API -> Auth : validar token
Auth --> API : usuario autenticado
API -> Service : createQuestion(draft, login)
Service -> Pipeline : run(draft)
Pipeline --> Service : borrador validado
Service -> DB : guardar pregunta + opciones
Service -> MQ : question.created (eventId)
MQ -> Audit : auditoria.preguntas / question.created
Audit -> Audit : deduplicar eventId y guardar
API --> Autor : 201 Created
note over Service,MQ
Si el broker falla, la operación local puede persistir sin evento; no hay Outbox.
Fuentes: banco-service/.../api/QuestionController.java, service/QuestionService.java, pipeline/QuestionPipeline.java, events/RabbitEventPublisher.java; auditoria-service/.../events/QuestionEventListener.java.
end note
@enduml